{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"b1fb7621ac61640e","type":"link","url":"https://x.com/hanabushi_/status/1299886399156436994/photo/1?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw%7Ctwcamp%5Etweetembed%7Ctwterm%5E1299886399156436994%7Ctwgr%5E%7Ctwcon%5Es1_&ref_url=","x":880,"y":-880,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# 黎黎隆｜限定色角色设计灵感墙\n\n**核心：同一盒颜色，长出完全不同的人。**\n\n允许色族（由原稿取样，近似）：\n- 深黑青 `#192B34`\n- 灰紫 `#825D88`\n- 暗砖红 `#8C3C45`\n- 青绿 `#68CFCB`\n- 冰灰白 `#D6E4E4`\n\n规则：单角色优先 2–4 色，不要求五色齐全。","x":0,"y":0,"width":430,"height":260,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"seed1","type":"file","file":"assets/seed_characters.png","x":-520,"y":-180,"width":450,"height":260},
		{"id":"seed2","type":"file","file":"assets/seed_process.png","x":-520,"y":110,"width":450,"height":280},
		{"id":"palette","type":"file","file":"黎黎隆项目/黎黎隆_场景视觉化_v1/assets/palette_crop.png","x":-20,"y":-310,"width":300,"height":230},
		{"id":"ratio","type":"text","text":"## ① 色块比例\n\n研究同一套色在不同角色中的**面积占比**。\n\n例：黑65 / 白25 / 青8 / 红2。\n\n目标：颜色少，但角色排成一列仍明显不同。","x":520,"y":-430,"width":360,"height":210,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"placement","type":"text","text":"## ② 色块位置\n\n研究颜色**长在身体哪里**。\n\n头 / 胸 / 手 / 腿 / 关节 / 内衬 / 眼睛 / 尾巴。\n\n不要把“颜色清单”误当设计。","x":760,"y":-130,"width":360,"height":210,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"silhouette","type":"text","text":"## ③ 剪影结构\n\n色卡越少，剪影越重要。\n\n高矮、肩胯、帽型、袖型、尾巴、道具、上下身比例先拉开。","x":760,"y":180,"width":360,"height":210,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"material","type":"text","text":"## ④ 同色异材质\n\n同一个青：玻璃 / 神经 / 釉 / 液体 / 鳞片 / 电路 / 织物。\n\n**青色不得自动等于赛博科技。**","x":520,"y":480,"width":360,"height":210,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"fantasy","type":"text","text":"## ⑤ NZ奇幻用色\n\n让原有奇幻世界先成立：布料、骨、陶瓷、羽毛、鳞片、宗教物、传统服饰。\n\n色卡保持统一，材质属于 NZ 世界本体。","x":120,"y":560,"width":360,"height":210,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"tech","type":"text","text":"## ⑥ Z技术化用色\n\n技术化从原世界内部长出来：接口、嵌合、包裹、功能构件。\n\n不是整套换成 generic cyberpunk。","x":-320,"y":560,"width":360,"height":210,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"reject","type":"text","text":"## ⑦ 反例区\n\n**禁止默认：**\n- RGB霓虹\n- 黑紧身衣+发光线\n- 全身青紫渐变\n- generic techwear\n- hologram everywhere\n\n反例也要进墙，防止搜索和模型偷懒。","x":-650,"y":410,"width":360,"height":210,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"ref_han","type":"link","url":"https://x.com/hanabushi_/status/1299886399156436994","x":900,"y":-500,"width":360,"height":210},
		{"id":"ref_han_note","type":"text","text":"**Hanabushi / KUNG-FU-PIGGY**\n\n色块比例 / 黑色主体 + 青紫局部结构标记\n\n`待本地化：参考图 Skill`","x":930,"y":-280,"width":330,"height":130},
		{"id":"ref_promare_lio","type":"link","url":"https://www.crunchyroll.com/es/news/latest/2019/4/5/la-pelcula-promare-de-studio-trigger-y-xflag-estrena-triler-con-tema-musical-incluido","x":1160,"y":-180,"width":330,"height":210},
		{"id":"ref_promare_lio_note","type":"text","text":"**PROMARE / Lio Fotia**\n\n黑白主体 + 极少薄荷绿/紫；学习减法与大形\n\n`待本地化：参考图 Skill`","x":1160,"y":40,"width":330,"height":130},
		{"id":"ref_promare_gueira","type":"link","url":"https://www.online-station.net/anime/241748","x":1160,"y":100,"width":440,"height":340},
		{"id":"ref_promare_gueira_note","type":"text","text":"**PROMARE / Gueira**\n\n红黑青灰在角色头部与服装上的区域分配\n\n`待本地化：参考图 Skill`","x":1160,"y":320,"width":330,"height":130},
		{"id":"ref_adventure","type":"link","url":"https://www.behance.net/gallery/116174935/Character-Design-for-Adventure-Time","x":930,"y":440,"width":330,"height":380},
		{"id":"ref_adventure_note","type":"text","text":"**Adventure Time fan character / Colour Tests**\n\n同一线稿多套色方案对照；适合研究“比例变化而非加色”\n\n`待本地化：参考图 Skill`","x":930,"y":820,"width":330,"height":80},
		{"id":"ref_avarik","type":"link","url":"https://avariksaga.com/news/avarik-saga-dev-diary-2/","x":510,"y":760,"width":330,"height":210},
		{"id":"ref_avarik_note","type":"text","text":"**Avarik Saga / Color Exploration**\n\n幻想角色多套配色探索；防止同色卡只长出科技感\n\n`待本地化：参考图 Skill`","x":510,"y":980,"width":330,"height":130},
		{"id":"ref_ena","type":"link","url":"https://knowyourmeme.com/photos/2065472-ena","x":40,"y":800,"width":330,"height":350},
		{"id":"ref_ena_note","type":"text","text":"**ENA / Joel G concept**\n\n大色块、硬边界、强图形化；研究少颜色下的角色辨识\n\n`待本地化：参考图 Skill`","x":40,"y":1180,"width":330,"height":60},
		{"id":"ref_fantasy","type":"link","url":"https://x.com/tokake_0/status/2056732978227876167","x":-430,"y":800,"width":330,"height":210},
		{"id":"ref_fantasy_note","type":"text","text":"**Teal / Black / Red fantasy turnaround**\n\n同一青黑红用于层叠奇幻服装、披风、纹样，而非赛博\n\n`待本地化：参考图 Skill`","x":-430,"y":1020,"width":330,"height":130},
		{"id":"ref_myra","type":"link","url":"https://www.foriio.com/works/1919603","x":-850,"y":690,"width":330,"height":210},
		{"id":"ref_myra_note","type":"text","text":"**Myra Mors costume sheet**\n\n角色卡直接记录色卡与部件；适合转成最终 Character Bible\n\n`待本地化：参考图 Skill`","x":-850,"y":910,"width":330,"height":130},
		{"id":"skill","type":"text","text":"## Canvas参考图本地化 Skill v0.2\n\n1. 扫描 Canvas 中 `type: link` 且带“待本地化”标记的参考。\n2. 抽取页面主图 / og:image / 搜索结果预览。\n3. 下载 **512–1200px 预览图** 到 `assets/refs/`。\n4. 文件名：`轴_作者或作品_序号.ext`。\n5. 记录来源 URL、作者/作品、用途、检索日期到 `SOURCES.md`。\n6. 将 Canvas 的 link 节点替换/旁挂为 `type:file` 本地图节点。\n7. 失败时保留 link，不得塞登录页截图。\n8. 去重：URL + 感知哈希；同图不同站只留来源更清楚者。\n\n**硬规则：Canvas 必须能离线看参考缩略图，来源链接同时保留。**","x":-960,"y":-60,"width":390,"height":390,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"19f8be2d8cd5f4f6","type":"link","url":"https://i.kym-cdn.com/photos/images/original/002/065/472/30f.jpg","x":500,"y":980,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"71533834207fd83b","type":"link","url":"https://x.com/tokake_0/status/2056732978227876167/photo/1?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw%7Ctwcamp%5Etweetembed%7Ctwterm%5E2056732978227876167%7Ctwgr%5E%7Ctwcon%5Es1_&ref_url=","x":-500,"y":1020,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"c034595b48a92968","type":"link","url":"https://img.foriio.com/images/id/3901169?w=750&fm=webp","x":-920,"y":960,"width":400,"height":400},
